mavrik's macOS change to Proton's steam_helper/steam.c (BSD-3-Clause, Valve), at 5b89db9: the stub
keeps its in-place restart and logs and drops every other command it would forward to a native
steam command. A Mac has none, and forwarding to the Steam app would open its window.
Under BSD-3-Clause, like steam.c (Proton's LICENSE.proton).

--- a/programs/steam/steam.c
+++ b/programs/steam/steam.c
@@ -697,6 +697,14 @@
         return TRUE;
     }
 
+    /* mavrik (macOS): there is no steam-runtime-steam-remote or steam command to forward to, and
+     * forwarding to the Mac Steam app would open its window. Log and drop the request. */
+    WINE_ERR("Not forwarding");
+    for (i = 0; i < argc; ++i)
+        WINE_ERR(" %s", wine_dbgstr_a(argv[i]));
+    WINE_ERR(" to the Steam app.\n");
+    return TRUE;
